**The UVLO is without function on this Hardware**
This is the third hardware version of the dual ant esc
Changes:  -Changed the programing pads to multilayer to make it easier to program with a serial adapter
          -Added through holes to the VIN, GND and motor pads, to give the option to add 2.54mm pitch throughole pins
          -Changed the 5V TVS diodes to unidirectional to better protect the MCU
          -Added pulldown and series resistors on the signal pins to prevent undefined states on the MCU and better protect the MCU
          -Added series Resistor on the UDPI pin to better protect the MCU
